; Reference-based card HUD. Keep the companion PNG beside this OVL.
; Fixed frame/icons/labels are an image atlas; all readings and states are live.
; Pin balance means reported max-minus-min current below 1.50 A; not a hardware protection state.
; Physical readings retain two decimals. Fonts, shapes and static labels match the reference closely.
[Master]
Implementation=2
FontFace=Consolas
FontHeight=-14
FontWeight=700
ZoomRatio=1

